  "description": "This dataset contains magnetoencephalography (MEG) recordings from human subjects engaged in a model-based aversive learning task. The study investigates the neural mechanisms supporting aversive learning by examining task state reactivation patterns during memory consolidation. Raw MEG data are provided as .fif files to support reproducible analysis of learning-related neural dynamics.",
